1265
01:25:19,785 --> 01:25:21,611
Give me a towel. Hold him.
ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍກະທູ້. ຈັບລາວໄວ້.

1266
01:25:28,914 --> 01:25:30,325
You wanna be a nigger,
