1274
01:26:35,281 --> 01:26:37,651
Well, he took six stitches.
ດີ, ລາວໄດ້ຮັບການຕັດຫົກຄັ້ງ.

1275
01:27:19,052 --> 01:27:21,588
Man,what the hell are you
